{"text":"Like exposing myself to cross bike when I join students much younger than me to travel by bus to Washington, D.C. to demonstrate against U.S. involvement in the Vietnam War. It is difficult to imagine arriving at all that I have achieved today without the starting opportunity to study at Harvard. It is therefore for me a profound honor to be counted as an alumni. I speak with utter gratitude and humility when I salute my fellow graduates who share the rich Harvard heritage of academic excellence and truthful pursuits.","words":[{"text":"Like","start":0.0,"end":0.82},{"text":"exposing","start":0.82,"end":1.42},{"text":"myself","start":1.42,"end":2.02},{"text":"to","start":2.02,"end":2.26},{"text":"cross","start":2.26,"end":2.54},{"text":"bike","start":2.54,"end":2.82},{"text":"when","start":2.82,"end":3.06},{"text":"I","start":3.06,"end":3.26},{"text":"join","start":3.26,"end":3.54},{"text":"students","start":3.54,"end":3.98},{"text":"much","start":3.98,"end":4.26},{"text":"younger","start":4.26,"end":4.68},{"text":"than","start":4.68,"end":4.88},{"text":"me","start":4.88,"end":5.12},{"text":"to","start":5.12,"end":5.3},{"text":"travel","start":5.3,"end":5.7},{"text":"by","start":5.7,"end":5.98},{"text":"bus","start":5.98,"end":6.24},{"text":"to","start":6.24,"end":6.86},{"text":"Washington","start":6.86,"end":6.86,"punct":","},{"text":"D.C","start":7.08,"end":7.54,"punct":"."},{"text":"to","start":7.76,"end":8.14},{"text":"demonstrate","start":8.14,"end":8.66},{"text":"against","start":8.66,"end":9.0},{"text":"U.S","start":9.0,"end":9.4,"punct":"."},{"text":"involvement","start":9.44,"end":9.9},{"text":"in","start":9.9,"end":10.2},{"text":"the","start":10.2,"end":10.32},{"text":"Vietnam","start":10.32,"end":10.68},{"text":"War","start":10.68,"end":11.12,"punct":"."},{"text":"It","start":17.26,"end":17.9},{"text":"is","start":17.9,"end":18.08},{"text":"difficult","start":18.08,"end":18.52},{"text":"to","start":18.52,"end":20.06},{"text":"imagine","start":20.